# Vulnerabilities formally accepted for the Trivy gate (cd.yml). Each entry needs a reason and an expiry date,
# for example:   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
# Security plan: docs/documentation-technique.md, sections 5.2 and 5.3.
#
# History: CVE-2026-47884 and CVE-2026-47890 (spring-webmvc 6.2) were accepted until 2027-01-31 (decision SEC01),
# then removed when Spring Boot 4.2 (Spring Framework 7.1) fixed them (SEC02). No accepted vulnerability today.
